'''2015''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[codes|code]] "2015". It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is dark brown with multicolored fireworks imprinted on it. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black with 2015 imprinted on it in white, hence the name. 

== Trivia ==
*This is the only New Years themed knife to be released.
*It is the fourth code knife to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]], the others being [[Gifted]], [[Reptile]], and [[Neon]].
*The code for this knife released on December 31st, 2014, and the code could only be redeemed for 24 hours before officially expiring<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/550462500387688449</ref>.
*The “2015” on the handle is reversed from the other side. 

